I left out the `aap:caps/http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the graph definition hasn't been updated yet. Once the graph grants `http-client`, it can be added. Sending untrusted feed text in an outbound URL would also be a data-leak path, so that call needs its own review.

